SUMMARY:Second Saturday Cartoonist: Tara Benhudjiriras
DESCRIPTION:Meet\, watch\, and talk to visual storyteller Tara Benhudjiriras\, whose work uses inks\, watercolors\, and digital art to explore folklore\, life\, and the intersection of the beautiful and grotesque.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/second-saturday-cartoonist-tara-benhudjiriras/
CATEGORIES:Calendar of Events
