DESCRIPTION:Keep your kids engaged over the holidays at the Schulz Museum! Camps include STEAM\, art\, cooking\, LEGO animation\, and more! Advance registration required.
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/winter-break-camps-for-kids-4/
