SUMMARY:LEGO Animation 1 (Grades 1-6)
DESCRIPTION:This camp is sold out. Please check back regularly for possible openings. Work in small\, age-appropriate groups to build LEGO sets and film a stop-motion animated movie featuring sound effects\, titles\, and credits. Instructor: Mike Marquez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/lego-animation-1-grades-1-6/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Charles M. Schulz Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261221T090000
