LAST-MODIFIED:20261119T164043Z
UID:10004582-1797930000-1797957000@schulzmuseum.org
SUMMARY:Reindeer Games (Grades 1-3)
DESCRIPTION:This camp is sold out. Please check back regularly for possible openings. Like Dasher and Donner\, spend the day playing reindeer games and exploring the Schulz Museum! Go on a candy-cane scavenger hunt\, race through an obstacle course\, make reindeer chow\, and craft an ornament to take home. Instructor: Rachael Juarez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/reindeer-games-grades-1-3/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
END:VEVENT
