SUMMARY:Holiday Gift-Making (Grades 1-6)
DESCRIPTION:This camp is sold out. Please check back regularly for possible openings. Have fun making handmade gifts for your family and friends! Mix a creamsicle sugar scrub and lavender bath soak\, make jewelry holder pinch pots\, create sparkling ornaments\, and more. Instructor: Angelica Blancas-Mims
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/holiday-gift-making-grades-1-6/
CATEGORIES:Classes & Camps
