DESCRIPTION:Get into the holiday spirit by mixing and making your own tasty treats! Stack cucumber holiday trees\, blend melting-snowman smoothies\, and concoct a holiday snack mix in a jar. Children must be at least 4 years old to enroll. Instructor: Mike Marquez
URL:https://schulzmuseum.org/event/kids-cook-for-the-holidays-mini-grades-tk-k/
