SUMMARY:Reindeer Games Mini (Grades TK-K)
DESCRIPTION:Spend the day playing reindeer games and making reindeer crafts. Go on a candy-cane scavenger hunt through the Museum\, race through an obstacle course\, and make a reindeer ornament to take home! Then\, wind down with free-choice sensory play and homemade reindeer chow to enjoy! Children must be at least 4 years old to enroll. Instructor: Rachael Juarez
