DESCRIPTION:This camp is sold out. Please check back regularly for possible openings.  Learn watercolor techniques and explore color mixing\, stippling\, and textures. Then paint winter animals and landscapes near and far\, inspired by music and vivid soundscapes. Instructor: Mike Marquez
